---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "在中国看病：诊所、医院与保险指南";
const description = "旅行者必知：在中国看病去哪看、花多少、怎么办，以及旅行保险该不该买。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        返回生活指南
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏥 医疗保障</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        在中国看病旅行者必知
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">在外生病受伤不用慌——找对地方就行。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026 年 6 月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：6 分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>中国有世界级的医疗水平，但看病方式和你想的不太一样。</strong>小问题去药店，不急去诊所，严重了去公立医院国际部。费用比欧美便宜一大截，但<strong>出发前一定买好旅行保险。</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本文目录</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#levels" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏥 三级医疗体系</a></li>
        <li><a href="#cost" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💰 看病要花多少钱</a></li>
        <li><a href="#emergency" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚑 医疗紧急情况怎么办</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        在中国生病或受伤了，实话是：<strong>找对地方就没事。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        中国有顶尖的医院，尤其在大城市。但医疗体系和你想的不一样，知道该去哪能省时间、省钱、少折腾。
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-12">
        这篇指南讲三件事：去哪看、花多少、出发前怎么准备。
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="levels" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏥</span> 三级医疗体系
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-8 mb-12 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-3">💊 1. 药店 (yào diàn)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">感冒、头疼、肠胃不舒服、过敏这类小问题，直接去药店。中国城市几乎每条街都有药店。</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li>常见药不需要处方就能买到</li>
            <li>店员一般不会英语，最好把药名翻译好或存张照片</li>
            <li>常见连锁药店：<strong>大参林</strong>、<strong>国大药房</strong>、<strong>老百姓大药房</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3">🩺 2. 诊所</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">发烧、感染、轻伤这类需要看医生但不是紧急的情况，去诊所最合适。</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>国际诊所</strong>（如百汇、和睦家）有英语医生和海外培训背景，但收费较高</li>
            <li><strong>社区卫生中心</strong>每个社区都有，便宜又方便，但基本不说英语</li>
            <li>大部分酒店能推荐附近接待过外国人的诊所</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-purple-900 mb-3">🏥 3. 医院 (yī yuàn)</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">胸痛、重伤、高烧不退这类严重情况，直接去医院。</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>公立医院国际部</strong>——最适合旅行者的选择</li>
            <li>顶级医院的急诊科什么都能处理</li>
            <li><strong>打 120</strong> 叫救护车，或打滴滴/打车去医院——打车通常更快</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="cost" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💰</span> 看病要花多少钱
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">这是最让欧美旅行者意外的事：<strong>中国看病比欧美便宜太多了。</strong></p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">项目</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">人民币</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center">约合美元</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">药店买药（常见药）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥20–100</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$3–15</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">诊所看诊</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥200–800</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$30–118</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">国际诊所看诊</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥800–2,000</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$118–295</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">公立医院急诊</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥300–500</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$44–74</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">公立医院国际部</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥600–1,500</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$80–220</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">住院（每天）</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥500–3,000</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$74–443</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">大手术</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">¥20,000–100,000</td><td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">$2,954–14,771</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-8 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>注意：</strong>出发前一定买好旅行保险。虽然比欧美便宜，但真的要住院做手术，几万块也是有的。买份覆盖中国的保险很必要。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="emergency" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🚑</span> 医疗紧急情况怎么办
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <div><strong>打 120</strong> — 叫救护车。接线员可以转接英语帮助</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <div><strong>或者直接去最近的大医院</strong> — 用滴滴打车（有轨迹，又快又安全）</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <div><strong>带上护照</strong> — 医院挂号需要</div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="bg-blue-600 text-white w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <div><strong>出示保险卡</strong> — 如果有旅行保险，马上打电话给他们协调付款</div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-lg text-center mb-4">📱 <strong>把这段话存到手机里：</strong></p>
        <div class="bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-3">我是外国人，需要帮助。请带我去国际部或能找到英语翻译的地方。</p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-2"><em>(Wǒ shì wàiguó rén, xūyào bāngzhù. Qǐng dài wǒ qù guójì bù huò néng zhǎodào yīngyǔ fānyì de dìfāng.)</em></p>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-800 font-semibold">"I'm a foreigner and need help. Please take me to the International Department or somewhere with English translation."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/life/top-hospitals/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">顶尖国际部医院推荐</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">中国最适合外国人的医院</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/travel-insurance/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">中国旅行保险指南</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">出发前需要了解的</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/emergency-numbers/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">紧急电话与应对指南</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">需要之前先存好</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>